sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Merchant
  participant GW as Payment Gateway
  participant P as Provider

  M->>GW: POST /v1/payments (Idempotency-Key, method)
  GW->>GW: PaymentFlows.forMethod(method)
  GW->>GW: store payment CREATED
  alt PIX · BOLECODE (Itaú)
    GW->>P: create charge / boleto + Pix QR
    P-->>GW: QR (and barcode)
    GW->>GW: PENDING + outbox event
  else CARD (Cielo)
    GW->>P: authorize (capture or not)
    P-->>GW: approved / declined
    GW->>GW: COMPLETED · AUTHORIZED · FAILED + outbox event
  end
  GW-->>M: 201 { id, status, pix · boleto · card }
